{"id": "EUVD-2026-103056", "enisaUuid": "52f4f386-8c12-3884-ae08-6240ed991493", "description": "Helical Insight through 7.0.0 contains an sql injection vulnerability that allows authenticated viewers to inject SQL through unescaped report parameter values sent to /executeDatasource. Attackers can supply crafted Numeric or String placeholder values that bypass the broken SqlDetect guard to read unexposed tables and modify data in the report's data source.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:06", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T20:44:36", "baseScore": 8.6, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/helicalinsight-efwd-parameter-sqli", "https://github.com/helicalinsight/helicalinsight/blob/v7.0.0/server/core/src/main/java/com/helicalinsight/datasource/EfwdQueryProcessor.java#L220-L235", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/helical-insight-through-7.0.0-sql-injection-via-executedatasource"], "aliases": ["GHSA-cjph-845q-jxp4", "CVE-2026-111634"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.26, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "011d6ab7-57f1-30ea-9957-f0cc348e6fa4", "product": {"name": "helicalinsight", "vendor": {"name": "helicalinsight"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22647.0.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "f73cafcd-70c6-3ebb-aabe-c440a178fba6", "vendor": {"name": "helicalinsight"}}], "isExploited": false}